'''Flame Dragon Rider''' (フレイムドラゴンライダー, ''Fureimu Doragon Raidā'', '''Flaming Dragon Rider''') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 4.6 Update|Version 4.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Flame Dragon Rider
|image = E 226.png
|appearance = [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 400円 - 1,580円
}}

==Enemy==
Even though its appearance may seem threatening, it is quite the opposite. While it has above-average health, it also has low attack power, Single Target attacks and no special ability. These setbacks make Flame Dragon Rider no stronger than your average [[Mooth]].

==Strategy==
Anything can easily defeat the Flame Dragon Rider, although [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating Cats]] are best used due to its Floating trait.

